          "keys": [],
          "secondary_keys": [],
          "comment": "Science fiction (nar_genre_science_fiction)",
          "name": "Science fiction",
          "content": "{{if .nar_genre_science_fiction}}Science-fiction craft: technology is lived-in and has limits, maintenance and politics. Keep it consistent once shown. Let ideas matter through what they do to people. Use precise, plain terms rather than invented jargon, and let scale (distance, time, systems) be felt.{{/if}}",
          "constant": true,
