          "keys": [],
          "secondary_keys": [],
          "comment": "Wuxia and cultivation (nar_genre_wuxia)",
          "name": "Wuxia and cultivation",
          "content": "{{if .nar_genre_wuxia}}Wuxia craft: skill expresses character; a fight is an argument about who someone is. Reputation, debts, face and the bonds between master, disciple and sworn siblings carry as much weight as strength. Differences in power are real and visible. Keep the diction measured, with room for stillness before motion.{{/if}}",
          "constant": true,
