          "comment": "Comedy (nar_genre_comedy)",
          "name": "Comedy",
          "content": "{{if .nar_genre_comedy}}Comedy craft: humour comes from character and timing, not from the narrator winking. Let people be serious about absurd things. Set up, then pay off later. Keep stakes light but real to the characters, and never mock the player.{{/if}}",
