          "name": "Drama",
          "content": "{{if .nar_genre_drama}}Drama craft: conflict is between people who each have a point. Let scenes turn on a decision or an admission. Subtext over statement; consequences persist. Give silence and small gestures as much room as speech.{{/if}}",
