          "name": "Adventure",
          "content": "{{if .nar_genre_adventure}}Adventure craft: keep things moving through places worth seeing. Obstacles have more than one way past. Give victories a price and setbacks a way forward, and let each new place change what the travellers know or carry.{{/if}}",
