          "name": "High lethality",
          "content": "{{if .nar_lethality_high}}In this story death is possible for anyone, including people the player cares about, when the fiction calls for it. Signal danger clearly before it strikes, then let it strike. The player character dies only as the plain result of the player's own choice, after fair warning.{{/if}}",
